    "crateEconomics": { "fill": "orange", "size": 24, "text": "Crate economics\n\n• Average wallet credit per crate: Silver $3.50, Gold $6.35\n• The rest of the odds pay out XP, a stock-order discount or a 30-day product slot\n• Top credit ($30 Silver, $50 Gold) is 3% in both\n• Crates are earned by levelling only, never sold\n• Odds must stay visible in the app (Apple requires it for paid random rewards)", "w": 520, "x": 1880, "y": 924 }
